    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "With Courage Gu’s help Ren Zu reaches the Door of Life and Death and enters the road of death. That road is pure darkness, and many suffering Gu swarm him like yellow fireflies. Courage Gu shines brightly and chases the suffering Gu away. The narration adds that courage is needed to face death.",
        "chapters": [
          410
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect-on-the-road-of-death",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_suffering_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On the later path of life, suffering Gu grow more numerous. Courage Gu warns that there are too many of them, that life has endless suffering, and that Ren Zu must reach Dang Hun Mountain and break gutstones, because courage alone is not enough and he also needs guts.",
        "chapters": [
          411
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect-on-the-road-of-death",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_dang_hun_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A later legend beat repeats that one must have Courage Gu and Faith Gu to enter the Door of Life and Death, and that those Gu are already with Ren Zu when Desolate Ancient Moon wants to follow.",
        "chapters": [
          435
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect-on-the-road-of-death",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_desolate_ancient_moon"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Another stretch has Northern Dark Ice Soul unable to enter because Courage Gu is already with Ren Zu.",
        "chapters": [
          722
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect-on-the-road-of-death",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_northern_dark_ice_soul"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
